{"articleNo":"332142","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=332142&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [한국정보기술연구원] 국비지원 IT 취업 교육 과정 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.11.02","hit":"42059","attachments":[{"name":"1.정보보호시스템 보안 인프라 구축을 통한 사이버공격 대응 정보보호 전문가 양성과정.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=332142&attachNo=105919"},{"name":"2.솔루션 운영을 위한 웹 프로그래밍 개발구축 전문가 양성과정.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=332142&attachNo=105920"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">한국정보기술연구원은&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">산업통산자원부 산하기관</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">이며&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">소프트웨어 연구개발 및 인력양성</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">을 목적으로 설립되었습니다.</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">저희 연구원에서 올해 마지막 2021년도 12월&nbsp;IT 취업 교육 과정을 모집중&nbsp;입니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">취업이 필요한 졸업예정자 또는&nbsp;기졸업자&nbsp;학생들에게 많은 홍보 부탁드립니다.</span></span></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1.8; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1.8; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">◆ 과정 소개</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1.8; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;- 사업명&nbsp;: 국가기간·전략산업직종훈련&nbsp;(고용노동부 위탁 교육과정)</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1.8; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;- 교육과정 :</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">정보보호시스템 보안 인프라 구축을 통한 사이버공격 대응 정보보호 전문가 양성과정 </span></strong></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1.8; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (21년 12월 13일~ 22년 5월 27일,&nbsp; 110일 과정)</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1.8; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">솔루션 운영을 위한 웹 프로그래밍 개발/구축 전문가 양성과정</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1.8; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (21년 12월 13일~ 22년 5월 27일,&nbsp; 110일 과정)</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1.8; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;- 교육비 :&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">무료&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">(교재지급, 훈련비 지급)</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1.8; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;- 기간 : 5~6개월</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1.8; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 140, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">※강점 : 1) 실무에서 사용하는 IT 기술 및 취업 교육&nbsp;실시</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1.8; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 140, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2) 한국정보기술연구원과 협약한 기업 취업 추천</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; line-height: 1.8; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 140, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 3) 무료 진행 및 훈련수당지급</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-transform: none; line-height: 1.8; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;- 과정신청 페이지 :&nbsp;</span><a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"http://www.kitri.re.kr/academy/it_education/edu_application_lst.web\" target=\"_blank\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">http://www.kitri.re.kr/academy/it_education/edu_application_lst.web</span></font></u></a></p><p style=\"text-transform: none; line-height: 1.8; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
